    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      394.39,
      286.4,
      473.6
    ],
    "text": "I hereby given notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      474.79,
      288.84,
      577.04
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired : Land called Walikkanwatta Extent about 01 R.04.0 P., depicted as Lot 01 in Surveyor General\u2019s Advanced Tracing Number P.P.G. 1097 and 25.05.1975 situated in 20-B Brakmanawatta Grama Niladaris Division in Balapitiya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Galle District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      577.3,
      278.51,
      603.72
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 \u2014 Walikkanwatta \u2014 Extent 01 R. 04.0 P.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      603.67,
      286.41,
      627.68
    ],
    "text": "North: Road and P.P.A. 1664 Lot No. 01; East: Walikkanwatta claimed by G.O.T. De Silva and Main",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      549.21,
      375.92
    ],
    "text": "Road; South: Bogahawatta claimed by Dilman Abesekara and Walikkanwatta claimed by G.O.T. De Silva; West: Dachchigedara Kuruduwatta claimed by L. Adlin and K. H. P. Sugathadasa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      387.43,
      539.39,
      514.88
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired* are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Balapitiya on 14th of September, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 07th of September, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
